<title>UK: Frome Co Ltd sets 146.7 mln Swiss franc one-yr FRN.</title>
<headline>Frome Co Ltd sets 146.7 mln Swiss franc one-yr FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager J.P. Morgan Switzerland.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FROME CO LTD</p>
<p> AMT   146.7 MLN SFR  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    20.FEB.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     FLAT	PAY DATE  L-12.FEB.97</p>
<p> EXP MOODY  AAA	 ISS PRICE  100.0     L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 1</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> NOTES	COLLATERALISED</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
